cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its results, please cite it as below."
title: "Brain Tumour MRI Classification: Leakage-Aware, Calibrated and Explainable EfficientNet-B0"
abstract: >-
  Four-way brain MRI slice classification (glioma, meningioma, pituitary tumour, no tumour) on the Kaggle Brain Tumor
  MRI Dataset with a perceptual-hash duplicate audit, a leakage-aware split, an EfficientNet-B0 fine-tuned on a CPU,
  temperature scaling with an uncertainty flag, sanity-checked explanation methods and an in-browser ONNX demo.
  Research and education project, not a medical device.
type: software
